{"id":"kulczynski","title":"Kulczynski-style ratio","family":"lock-step","definition":"reference","intro_en":"This registry convention compares total discrepancy with the smaller magnitude available at each coordinate. A small shared-magnitude denominator can amplify the result sharply. The animation exposes this denominator rather than hiding it in a generic distance score. Several different association coefficients share the Kulczynski name, so this particular formula is recorded explicitly.","intro_zh":"此登记约定用各坐标较小幅值的总和作为分母。共享幅值较小时，比值会显著放大。动图显式展示分母。Kulczynski 名称也用于其他关联系数，因此这里记录的只是所列的特定公式。","steps_en":["Keep the two series on the same sample grid; no shift or warping is estimated.","Accumulate absolute gaps; the highlighted point supplies one coordinate contribution.","Accumulate the coordinate contributions in sample order.","Divide by the total minimum shared magnitude."],"steps_zh":["在同一采样网格上比较两条序列，不估计平移或时间规整。","计算各坐标的绝对残差。","按采样顺序累积局部贡献。","用绝对差总和除以各坐标较小绝对幅值的总和。"],"formula":"sum_i abs(x_i-y_i) / sum_i min(abs(x_i),abs(y_i))","caveats_en":["The ratio is undefined at zero shared mass and is not bounded by one.","Sample alignment and amplitude units are part of the comparison protocol."],"caveats_zh":["共享总量为零时比值未定义，结果也不以 1 为上界。","采样对齐和幅值单位属于比较协议的一部分。"],"sources":[{"label":"Imported registry: explicit formula convention","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[1.0,1.5,2.4,3.7,4.5,3.8,2.6,2.1,2.8,3.8,4.1,3.3],"y":[1.3,1.8,2.0,3.2,5.2,4.4,2.9,1.6,2.6,3.1,4.4,3.9],"input_label":"Deterministic synthetic illustration; sample index is the time axis.","parameters":{"samples":12,"preprocessing":"none","domain":"strictly positive illustration","global_denominator":33.3},"result":{"label":"distance","value":0.1621621621621622,"detail":"Exact formula evaluation on the displayed aligned vectors."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Aligned samples","panel":{"kind":"lines","title":"Aligned samples","a